a&_nc_ohc=XkSKtfAvqDEQ7kNvwEYroEs&_nc_oc=Adp6Y80bRDXoq8OcH3Jgdy1R7hv-Aj1nWrKVDesljjplwfJGoALLzv00KED5oWf3CVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVyi-w0XwYpcyjSZgWtbpMr8LMyDUFW9CQMhOVmpVg9ZQ&oe=6B105538"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "2376318332830903", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304106_2376318336164236_3080670963787475875_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_BJjOV4spR4Q7kNvwHMq6L9&_nc_oc=Adrr8DpSxMnL2VEWX_N3LwfW2TablN5rB_YU2Q8vEk06VVKLvAc79Wn9Ee7z-Rz96yI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVIITXLsErrcRiG3-yEkdCIIf9oiKSCdMORPVzpwrOqsg&oe=6B103F24"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ape Skate Shootout", "keywords": ["shooter", "fps", "ape", "skate", "hangout"], "long_description": "Shoot. Skate. Toot. \n\nCome hang out at the Skate Park, where you can slide down half pipes and pull off sweet tricks while hanging out with your friends - and grab a gun to mow them down. \n\nIn Ape Skate Shootout you can : \n- Complete skateboard tricks and stunts to earn SkateCash, used to upgrade your character or the Skate Park itself\n- Charge your farts observing your gas meter, and use them to boost around the Skate Park (or to disrespect your fallen foes). \n- Find a variety of weapons to mow down other players and compete in tense deathmatches\n- Combine wacky gadgets and upgrade combos to become the sickest Ape on the half-pipe. \n- Private and public lobby codes to join friends easier\n\nFeaturing a unique locomotion system that's easy to learn and difficult to master, and simple gunplay mechanics with a varied upgrade system, every match of Ape Skate Shootout will feel completely different. ", "short_description": "Kick Ass and Pass Gas - Shoot, skate and toot your way around the Skate Park pulling off tricks and eliminating your opponents. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url